@HR_HostAddress = http://localhost:5012
@HR_Role = HR

### Danh sách hồ sơ
GET {{HR_HostAddress}}/employees?page=1&pageSize=20
X-Role: {{HR_Role}}

### Tra cứu
GET {{HR_HostAddress}}/employees?keyword=NV001
X-Role: {{HR_Role}}

### Thêm hồ sơ
POST {{HR_HostAddress}}/employees
Content-Type: application/json
X-Role: {{HR_Role}}

{
  "employeeCode": "NV001",
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "dateOfBirth": "1998-05-12",
  "gender": "Nam",
  "email": "vana@example.com",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "citizenId": "079198001234",
  "address": "Quận 1, TP.HCM"
}

### Cập nhật hồ sơ
PUT {{HR_HostAddress}}/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Role: {{HR_Role}}

{
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Văn A",
  "dateOfBirth": "1998-05-12",
  "gender": "Male",
  "email": "vana@example.com",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "citizenId": "079198001234",
  "address": "Quận 3, TP.HCM"
}

### Khóa hồ sơ
POST {{HR_HostAddress}}/employees/1/lock
X-Role: {{HR_Role}}
